        <p>To exercise any of these rights, please email <a href="mailto:privacy@myspanishvisa.com">privacy@myspanishvisa.com</a> with your name, contact details, and a description of your request. We will respond within 30 days. We may need to verify your identity before fulfilling the request.</p>

